WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.309
This slide is the map for
both parts of the deep dive,

2
00:00:03.309 --> 00:00:06.800
because one O U tree holds
four different populations.

3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:12.037
People are the HR track: HR and the
contractor source write their attributes.

4
00:00:12.037 --> 00:00:16.899
End-user devices are the Intune track:
device provisioning writes theirs.

5
00:00:16.899 --> 00:00:21.800
Servers are the Arc track: Arc
onboarding and Azure Policy write tags.

6
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:26.509
And service accounts, service
principals, workload identities and AI

7
00:00:26.509 --> 00:00:31.300
agents are the non-person track: their
owner's record is the source, not HR.

8
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.760
So what's the end state?
